cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use atomiX in academic or published work, please cite it as below."
title: atomiX
abstract: >-
  A replaceable, component- and profile-driven RISC-V and FPGA platform. atomiX
  composes a system from interchangeable component manifests, keeps an immutable
  management shell separate from a swappable accelerator role, and carries a
  research track covering FPGA partial reconfiguration, compute-personality
  transformation, and bounded self-adaptive ("Live FPGA") logic with explicit
  evidence gates.
type: software
authors:
